msgstr "Comandi remoti"

#: res/asbru.glade:9568
msgid ""
"<b>Integration of a KeePass database file</b>\n"
"<small>\n"
"Ásbrú is using the command line interface of <a href=\"https://"
"keepassxc.org\">KeePassXC</a>\n"
"to read any KeePass database file and use any entry to automate connection "
"inside Ásbrú.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Integrazione di un file di database KeePass</b>\n"
"<small>\n"
"Ásbrú usa l'interfaccia a riga di comando di <a href=\"https://"
"keepassxc.org\">KeePassXC</a>\n"
"per leggere i file di database KeePass e usarne le voci per automatizzare le "
"connessioni in Ásbrú.</small>"

#: res/asbru.glade:9602
